Hi,

I have had a number of different people inquire about a 4.1 release in
order to get a number of newer features into a release. However I am
also a little wary of the sysfs changes etc. breaking stuff.

In order to make sure we get urgent pending fixes in, this is a heads up
that I will try to do an mdadm-4.1 release sometime in January.

If you have anything urgent for mdadm that needs to get into the next
release, now would be a good time to speak up!

Thanks,
Jes
